Subject: [PATCH] /choose-plan: top 'Explore first' button becomes 'Skip'

---
 src/routes/_authenticated/choose-plan.tsx | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/routes/_authenticated/choose-plan.tsx b/src/routes/_authenticated/choose-plan.tsx
